    "detailed_description": "<strong>ACTION<br>DANGER<br>GROCERIES</strong><br><br><br>Haywire is a randomly generated action/platformer game, set inside the world\u2019s first fully automated department store. When the robotic staff suddenly go haywire, it\u2019s up to you to stop the AI that powers them. Take control of a rogue ex-cop, armed with only your gun, your wit, and a few grenades.<br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 unique, handcrafted rooms, randomly arranged into 5 levels.<br></li><li>Over 20 types of enemies and stage hazards.<br></li><li>10 challenging challenge maps to challenge yourself with.<br></li><li>A chiptune soundtrack, included free with the game.<br></li><li>4 colors!</li></ul><br>Note: After downloading the game, the soundtrack can be found in the Assets/Audio/Music folder.",
